From 7b9a15c4e667ef64ee7aaf70910d30dbc5cf9e4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 12 May 2026 21:11:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Improve AG Grid: incremental transactions, column filters,
 quick search, resizable subject panel
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- MessageGrid: use applyTransaction for row adds instead of replacing rowData;
  subject visibility moved to AG Grid external filter (onFilterChanged) so
  toggling subjects doesn't cause React re-renders; handle tab switches with
  a full rowData reset; auto-scroll uses getDisplayedRowCount for accuracy
- Add quick filter input bar that drives setGridOption('quickFilterText');
  getQuickFilterText added to Time and Size columns so formatted values match
- Enable agTextColumnFilter / agNumberColumnFilter on all data columns
- SubjectPanel: drag handle on right edge for free-form width resize (120–480px);
  collapse/expand toggle with chevron button

https://claude.ai/code/session_01AkrmDxxeHDSgFUecYSnsXa
